 VALUES ('920a1db1-968a-5bd1-9e1c-11e0fd1f3e39', 107, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'Docker and Containerization', 'Docker وتغليف', 'DevOps',
         'Build, run, and debug Docker containers; expose services via ports and volumes.', 'Build, run, and debug Docker containers; expose services via ports and volumes.',
         'Docker packages an app and its dependencies into a portable container. `docker run` starts a container, `-p` maps ports, and `-v` mounts volumes. A `Dockerfile` automates image build with `FROM`, `RUN`, `CMD`, and `EXPOSE`. Containers are ephemeral by design; persist data with named volumes or bind mounts.', 'Docker يغلف التطبيق واعتماءاته في حاوية نقلة. `docker run` يشغّل الحاوية، و`-p`Mapping المنافذ، و`-v` mounting volumes. ملف `Dockerfile` آلي image build بـ `FROM`, `RUN`, `CMD`, و `EXPOSE`. الحاويات مؤقتة بطبيعتها؛ جهَّز البيانات بحجوم مسمَّاة أو mountbind.', 90,
         'Dockerize a simple Node.js app and run it with port mapping.', 'Dockerize a simple Node.js app and run it with port mapping.',
         'A Dockerfile and a running container accessible via localhost.', 'A Dockerfile and a running container accessible via localhost.',
         ARRAY['Dockerfile creates working container', 'Container responds on mapped port', 'Named volume persists data']::text[], ARRAY['Dockerfile creates working container', 'Container responds on mapped port', 'Named volume persists data']::text[],
         'Reduce the image size by removing unnecessary layers', 'Reduce the image size by removing unnecessary layers',
         ARRAY['91']::text[], 'lesson')
