 VALUES ('c9555569-202b-5be0-8648-9843537f7a57', 108, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'CI/CD Pipelines', 'circles/Direct', 'CI/CD',
         'Set up automated testing and deployment with GitHub Actions or GitLab CI.', 'Set up automated testing and deployment with GitHub Actions or GitLab CI.',
         'A CI pipeline runs on every push: install deps, run tests, build the image, and deploy. Use actions/checkout, setup-node, and your custom test/script steps. Configure secrets for credentials. Deploy to a platform (Render, Fly.io, Railway) via their CLI or API. Enable rollbacks on failure.', 'أنبوبة CI تعمل على كل push: dependencies,tests, image build, deploy. استخدم actions/checkout, setup-node, والخطوات ustom test/script.Configure secrets for credentials. Deploy to a platform (Render, Fly.io, Railway) via their CLI or API. Enable rollbacks on failure.', 90,
         'Set up a CI pipeline that tests and deploys your app on every push.', 'Set up a CI pipeline that tests and deploys your app on every push.',
         'A .github/workflows CI file that tests and deploys your app.', 'A .github/workflows CI file that tests and deploys your app.',
         ARRAY['Workflow runs on push', 'Tests pass', 'Image builds successfully']::text[], ARRAY['تنفيذ التشغيل على كل push', 'الاختبارات تنجح', 'الصورة تُبنى successfully']::text[],
         'Add a pipeline step that runs a security scan on the Docker image', 'Add a pipeline step that runs a security scan on the Docker image',
         ARRAY['107']::text[], 'lesson')
