 VALUES ('8be0697e-d30b-5ecf-bcaf-459f23311f81', 111, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'Backend Review and Consolidation', 'Backend Review and Consolidation', 'Review',
         'Re-read your backend projects and fix: missing Dockerfiles, broken CI, unclear logs.', 'Re-read your backend projects and fix: missing Dockerfiles, broken CI, unclear logs.',
         'A review day. Take your backend work from days 97-110 and re-examine it. Look for: missing Dockerfiles or broken CI pipelines, logging that isn''t structured or redacted, poorly named services in docker-compose, any route that writes user data without validation. Fix each issue and run your test suite.', 'يوم مراجعة. خذ مشاريع backend من الأيام 97-110 وأعاده للبحث عن: missing Dockerfiles or broken CI pipelines, logging that isn''t structured or redacted, poorly named services in docker-compose, any route that writes user data without validation. Fix each issue and run your test suite.', 70,
         'Take your backend work and apply all improvements from days 97-110.', 'Take your backend work and apply all improvements from days 97-110.',
         'A consolidated backend portfolio with Docker, CI, and observability.', 'A consolidated backend portfolio with Docker, CI, and observability.',
         ARRAY['All Dockerfiles present', 'CI pipeline green', 'Structured logs in all services']::text[], ARRAY['جميع Dockerfiles موجودة', 'تنباخ CI أخضر', 'سجِّل JSON structured in all services']::text[],
         'Add a rollback step to your CI pipeline and verify it restores the previous version.', 'Add a rollback step to your CI pipeline and verify it restores the previous version.',
         ARRAY['110']::text[], 'review')
