 VALUES ('180f48f0-5a7d-5abd-9db0-3ae7bd5d96f0', 112, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'Cache Basics', 'Basics Cache', 'Caching',
         'Understand caching layers, HTTP headers, and prevent stale data.', 'Understand caching layers, HTTP headers, and prevent stale data.',
         'Caching improves performance by storing frequently accessed data closer to the client. Use Cache-Control headers to manage freshness, and ETag for conditional requests. Avoid caching sensitive data. A simple in-memory cache can reduce database load significantly.', 'تحسين الأداء عن طريق تخزين البيانات المستخدمة frequently closer to the client. استخدم Cache-Control headers لإدارة الانتعاش، و ETag للطلبات الشرطية. تجنب تخزين البيانات الحساسة. Cache بسيط في الذاكرة يمكن أن يقلل حمل database significantly.', 90,
         'Add Cache-Control headers and ETag support to an existing Express route.', 'Add Cache-Control headers and ETag support to an existing Express route.',
         'An Express route with Cache-Control and ETag headers.', 'Express route with Cache-Control and ETag headers.',
         ARRAY['Cache-Control header set', 'ETag generated', 'Passwords not cached']::text[], ARRAY['Header Cache-Control set', 'ETag Generated', 'passwords not cached']::text[],
         'Configure a cache that invalidates on data update', 'Configure a cache that invalidates on data update',
         ARRAY['107']::text[], 'lesson')
