 VALUES ('0922206d-c25e-5162-817e-801ed2212c97', 113, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'Error Handling and Retries', 'Handling Errors and Retries', 'Error Handling',
         'Implement graceful error handling and exponential backoff strategies.', 'Implement graceful error handling and exponential backoff strategies.',
         'Network requests can fail transiently. Use exponential backoff (1s, 2s, 4s, 8s) with a max retry count. Distinguish between client errors (4xx) and server errors (5xx) — never retry on 4xx. Use a library like p-retry or implement the pattern manually.', 'يمكن أن تفشل طلبات الشبكة بشكل مؤقت. استخدم экспоненциальный مع حد أقصى لعدد المحاولات.  بين أخطاء العميل (4xx) وأخطاء الخادم (5xx) — never retry on 4xx. Use a library like p-retry or implement the pattern manually.', 90,
         'Create a retry utility with exponential backoff and use it to call an external API.', 'Create a retry utility with exponential backoff and use it to call an external API.',
         'A retry utility function and a test script that uses it.', 'A retry utility function and a test script that uses it.',
         ARRAY['Function retries with exponential backoff', 'Max 3 attempts', 'Logs each attempt']::text[], ARRAY['Function retries with exponential backoff', 'Max 3 attempts', 'Logs each attempt']::text[],
         'Implement a retry that gives up after 5 failed attempts with jitter', 'Implement a retry that gives up after 5 failed attempts with jitter',
         ARRAY['112']::text[], 'lesson')
