 VALUES ('e6d85669-886d-5078-a118-c763513db641', 114, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'API Versioning Deep Dive', 'توثيق API عميق', 'API Design',
         'Support multiple API versions with separate schemas and tailored responses.', 'Support multiple API versions with separate schemas and tailored responses.',
         'Versioning can be URL-based (/v1, /v2) or header-based (Accept: v2). Each version may have a different data shape. Use a library like express-version-router or implement custom middleware. Document the deprecation policy for each version.', 'يمكن أن يكون الترقيم Based on URL (/v1, /v2) or header-based (Accept: v2). Each version may have a different data shape. Use a library like express-version-router or implement custom middleware. Document the deprecation policy for each version.', 100,
         'Version an existing Express route for v1 and v2 with different response shapes.', 'Version an existing Express route for v1 and v2 with different response shapes.',
         'An Express route available at /v1 and /v2 with distinct response schemas.', 'Express route available at /v1 and /v2 with distinct response schemas.',
         ARRAY['v1 and v2 routes functional', 'v3 deprecation header', 'Distinct response shapes']::text[], ARRAY['v1 و v2 routes functional', 'Header deprecation v2', 'أشكال response distinct']::text[],
         'Add a v3 route that deprecates v2 with a Link header', 'Add a v3 route that deprecates v2 with a Link header',
         ARRAY['113']::text[], 'practice')
