 VALUES ('3d01e131-1615-5ef9-9295-a54a2b984b82', 115, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'Rate Limiting and Throttling', 'Rate Limiting and Throttling', 'Security',
         'Implement sliding window and token bucket rate limiting strategies.', 'Implement sliding window and token bucket rate limiting strategies.',
         'Rate limiting caps requests in a time window. Sliding window tracks requests per time interval. Token bucket allows burst up to a cap. Combine with IP-based and user-based limits. Return 429 with a Retry-After header when the limit is exceeded.', 'تحديد الحد الأقصى للطلبات في نافذة زمنية. sliding window تتبع الطلبات لكل فترة زمنية. token bucket يسمح بالاندفاع حتى الحد الأقصى..Combine with IP-based and user-based limits. Return 429 with a Retry-After header when the limit is exceeded.', 120,
         'Set up rate limiting on an Express route with 429 handling.', 'Set up rate limiting on an Express route with a 429 response.',
         'Express route with rate limiting and 429 Retry-After header.', 'Express route with rate limiting and 429 Retry-After header.',
         ARRAY['Sliding window active', 'Token bucket with cap', '429 response on limit', 'IP + user combined']::text[], ARRAY['sliding window active', 'Token bucket with cap', '429 response on limit', 'IP + user combined']::text[],
         'Configure token bucket that allows 10 burst requests then refills at 5/min', 'Configure token bucket that allows 10 burst requests then refills at 5/min',
         ARRAY['114']::text[], 'project')
