 VALUES ('d619e24b-6515-5e17-b16b-9b86f3abcef6', 117, '249f74c7-cc2c-5c23-b6c8-1d896bb97022',
         'GraphQL Basics', 'Basics GraphQL', 'GraphQL',
         'Write GraphQL queries, mutations, and understand the schema language.', 'Write GraphQL queries, mutations, and understand the schema language.',
         'GraphQL allows clients to request exactly the data they need. A schema defines types and their relationships. Queries retrieve data, mutations modify it. Use introspection to explore the schema. Prevent deep queries with depth limits.', 'يسمح GraphQL للعملاء بطلب البيانات بالضبط التي تحتاجها. defines schema types and their relationships. Queries retrieve data, mutations modify it. Use introspection to explore the schema. Prevent deep queries with depth limits.', 90,
         'Create a GraphQL schema and query for a user profile.', 'Create a GraphQL schema and query for a user profile.',
         'A GraphQL schema with User type and a working query.', 'GraphQL schema with User type and a working query.',
         ARRAY['User type defined', 'Query fetches user by ID', 'Mutation creates user', 'Depth limiting active']::text[], ARRAY['User type defined', 'Query fetches user by ID', 'Mutation creates user', 'Depth limiting active']::text[],
         'Add a nested query that fetches a user and their posts in one request', 'Add a nested query that fetches a user and their posts in one request',
         ARRAY['116']::text[], 'lesson')
