         'WebSockets', 'WebSockets', 'Real-time',
         'Set up a WebSocket server, handle connections, and broadcast messages.', 'Set up a WebSocket server, handle connections, and broadcast messages.',
         'WebSockets enable full-duplex communication over a single TCP connection. Use the ws library to accept connections, send and receive messages. Broadcast to all connected clients or targeted recipients. Secure WebSockets (wss://) require HTTPS.', 'WebSockets enable full-duplex communication over a single TCP connection. Use the ws library to accept connections, send and receive messages. Broadcast to all connected clients or targeted recipients. Secure WebSockets (wss://) require HTTPS.', 90,
