         'Write migration files, manage schema changes, and roll back changes safely.', 'Write migration files, manage schema changes, and roll back changes safely.',
         'Migrations version your database schema. Use up and down functions to apply and revert changes. Never apply migrations directly to production without a backup. Test migrations in a development environment first.', ' migrations تنسخ schema قاعدة البيانات. استخدم up and down functions لتطبيق وإلغاء التغييرات. Never apply migrations directly to production without a backup. Test migrations in a development environment first.', 90,
