         'Full-Text Search', 'Full-Text Search', 'Search',
         'Implement full-text search using PostgreSQL tsvector and pg_trgm.', 'Implement full-text search using PostgreSQL tsvector and pg_trgm.',
         'PostgreSQL supports full-text search with tsvector and trigram extensions. Use to_tsquery for query parsing and @@ operator for ranking. pg_trgm provides similarity-based matching with % operator.', 'PostgreSQL يدعم البحث النصي الكامل بـ tsvector و pg_trgm. Use to_tsquery for query parsing and @@ operator for ranking. pg_trgm provides similarity-based matching with % operator.', 120,
