         'API Rate Limiting Patterns', 'Patterns Rate Limiting API', 'Rate Limiting',
         'Implement per-endpoint rate limits and distinguish between public and authenticated endpoints.', 'Implement per-endpoint rate limits and distinguish between public and authenticated endpoints.',
         'Not all endpoints should have the same rate limit. Public endpoints like search may have higher limits, while auth endpoints should be stricter. Use middleware to apply different limits per path, and store counters in Redis for distributed systems.', 'لا يجب أن يكون الحد نفسه لجميع endpoints. endpoints public comme search May have higher limits, while auth endpoints should be stricter. Use middleware to apply different limits per path, and store counters in Redis for distributed systems.', 90,
         'Set up per-endpoint rate limiting with Redis backing.', 'Set up per-endpoint rate limiting with Redis backing.',
         'Express middleware with per-endpoint rate limits and Redis counters.', 'Express middleware with per-endpoint rate limits and Redis counters.',
         ARRAY['Different limits per endpoint', 'Redis-backed counters', '429 with Retry-After']::text[], ARRAY['Different limits per endpoint', 'Redis-backed counters', '429 with Retry-After']::text[],
         'Configure a burst-allowed limit that resets after inactivity', 'Configure a burst-allowed limit that resets after inactivity',
