 VALUES ('1e5d1ad3-ff35-5572-9019-02588b8ce86f', 141, 'ef71b849-2224-52fd-8a8a-37520256275e',
         'Database Sharding', 'Database Sharding', 'Scaling',
         'Understand sharding strategies, key-based partitioning, and the trade-offs of distributed databases.', 'Understand sharding strategies, key-based partitioning, and the trade-offs of distributed databases.',
         'Sharding splits data across multiple databases based on a shard key. Choose a shard key that distributes load evenly. Trade-offs include increased complexity, cross-shard query limitations, and eventual consistency.', 'Sharding splits data across multiple databases based on a shard key. Choose a shard key that distributes load evenly. Trade-offs include increased complexity, cross-shard query limitations, and eventual consistency.', 90,
         'Design and document a sharding strategy for a sample application.', 'Design and document a sharding strategy for a sample application.',
         'A sharding strategy document and a routing function.', 'Strategy document and a routing function.',
         ARRAY['Shard key design documented', 'Routing function works', 'Cross-shard limitations noted']::text[], ARRAY['Shard key design documented', 'Routing function works', 'Cross-shard limitations noted']::text[],
